   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "This sounds far-fetched. But a version of it has already happened. Twice."
    },
    {
     "text": "On the eighth of November, 2016, India announced that its five hundred and one thousand rupee notes would stop being money at midnight."
    },
    {
     "text": "That was about eighty-six percent of all the cash in the country."
    }
